# CURSOR RULES — MANDATORY FOR EVERY TASK
# Project: Kemal Usman Parfum Shop (React 19 + PocketBase + Capacitor)

## 1. POCKETBASE SCHEMA SAFETY (MOST IMPORTANT)
- NEVER delete or rename existing PocketBase collection fields — live user data exists
- After ANY collection field change, update `pb-setup.js` to match
- Only ADD new fields; never remove old ones
- If renaming is needed, keep the old field AND add the new one
- NEVER change field types on existing collections without explicit instruction

## 2. API CONTRACT — NO BREAKING CHANGES
- NEVER rename or remove existing `api.*` methods in App.jsx
- NEVER change the shape/keys of objects returned by `api.*` methods
- Only ADD new methods; never restructure existing ones
- `products.variants` is a JSON array — never flatten it to separate price fields

## 3. APP.JSX — ONE FILE RULE
- NEVER split App.jsx into multiple files unless the user explicitly asks
- NEVER remove existing components, hooks, or helper functions
- NEVER change PB_URL (`http://145.223.100.16:8090`) without updating pb-setup.js
- NEVER hardcode phone numbers, prices, or passwords — always read from `settings`
- All styles are inline JS objects — no Tailwind, no CSS modules, no styled-components
- All colors come from the `T` object — never hardcode hex values directly in JSX

## 4. STATE & LOCALSTORAGE SAFETY
- Cart is persisted in `localStorage` key `parfum_cart`
- Every cart mutation (add/remove/qty change) MUST call `localStorage.setItem('parfum_cart', JSON.stringify(next))`
- `settings` object is the single source of truth for config values
- NEVER clear localStorage without explicit user action

## 5. DESKTOP / MOBILE SPLIT
- Desktop layout (≥ 1024px): `DesktopLayout` component
- Mobile layout (< 1024px): original mobile screens — DO NOT touch these when working on desktop features
- Admin panel on desktop: separate desktop admin wrapper (not the mobile shell)
- isDesktop check: `windowWidth >= 1024 && !isAdmin` → DesktopLayout

## 6. DEPLOY CHECKLIST
Before every `npm run build`:
- [ ] `npm run build` completes with 0 errors and 0 warnings?
- [ ] Changed any `api.*` method? → All callers in App.jsx updated?
- [ ] Changed PocketBase fields? → `pb-setup.js` updated?
- [ ] Changed component props? → All usages updated?
- [ ] Mobile layout (< 1024px) still works unchanged?
- [ ] Admin login flow works on both desktop and mobile?
- [ ] Cart syncs to localStorage on every mutation?
